# prometheus-snmp-exporter configuration
# This template configures the command-line arguments for the prometheus-snmp-exporter service.
# The 'args' variable is passed directly to the server executable.

# Set the command-line arguments to pass to the prometheus-snmp-exporter server.
# Due to shell escaping, to pass backslashes for regexes, you need to double
# them (\\d for \d). If running under systemd, you need to double them again
# (\\\\d to mean \d), and escape newlines too.
ARGS="{{ args | default('') }}"